 grids in Belmont County runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September on the county&rsquo;s middle value fell to 42% of normal and July to August to 60%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 145% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 24198 had its driest year in 1963 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
